<%# Org announcement banner for the casa_app (Tailwind) shell. Uses the same
    @active_banner + dismiss controller as the legacy layout.

    Deliberately plain: a tint, a hairline border, a leading glyph, the message, Dismiss. An icon tile
    and a left accent band were both tried and both reverted -- neither earned its place. %>
<% if @active_banner %>
  <div data-controller="dismiss" data-dismiss-target="element" data-dismiss-url-value="<%= dismiss_banner_path(@active_banner) %>" class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-900 sm:px-6">
    <%# A plain leading glyph, top-aligned to the first line -- NOT an icon tile. The icon-tile pattern
        is for contexts where the icon is the subject (KPI cards, empty states, section headers) and it
        assumes a white surface; a soft tile is invisible on this amber-50 bar (amber-100 measures
        1.07:1 against it), and the filled amber-700 tile that fixed the visibility shouted and pushed
        the bar from 44px to 57px. A message bar is not a card: every system that ships one -- Polaris
        Banner, Material, Carbon inline notification, Primer flash, Atlassian SectionMessage -- uses a
        bare tone-coloured glyph and lets the tint plus the border carry the semantics.
        The glyph inherits the container's amber-900 (8.73:1, well past the 3:1 WCAG 1.4.11 asks of
        non-text) and is text-base so it reads as an icon rather than a character. %>
    <i class="bi bi-megaphone mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-base leading-5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><%= @active_banner.content %></div>
    <%# A button, not <a href="#">: it performs an action rather than navigating, so a link
        mis-announces it to screen readers and does not activate on Space. amber-700 on amber-50
        is 4.87:1. %>
    <button type="button" data-action="click->dismiss#dismiss" class="shrink-0 rounded font-medium text-amber-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-amber-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-amber-600">Dismiss</button>
  </div>
<% end %>
